        "heading_fNnDyw": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How our prescribers are regulated",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_9JVri8": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our prescribers are Pharmacist Independent Prescribers regulated by the General Pharmaceutical Council. General Pharmaceutical Council (GPhC) is the independent regulator for pharmacists, pharmacy technicians and pharmacy premises in Great Britain.\u2028<\/p><p>Some of the prescribing services available through settlehealth are provided by Health Finder Pro Limited, an independent third-party clinical provider. Where applicable, your consultation information and relevant health data will be securely shared with Health Finder Pro Limited for the purposes of clinical review, prescribing, and ongoing medical management. Health Finder Pro Limited operates as an independent data controller in relation to the prescribing services it provides, more information can be found on our Privacy Policy, click here to view.<br\/><\/p>"
          }
        }
      },
