    "image_with_card_fMhbwt": {
      "type": "image-with-card",
      "blocks": {
        "caption_rtU43h": {
          "type": "caption",
          "settings": {
            "caption": "",
            "text_style": "subtitle",
            "text_size": "medium"
          }
        },
        "heading_7KXKRf": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Our North Star",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_jMaqpG": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>This is about you, not us. But it’s important to know how committed we are to your health. Here’s why we do what we do.<\/p><p><strong>Personalised to you <\/strong><\/p><p>A convincing social post, clever marketing campaign or recommendation from a friend. It’s human nature to be drawn in. But one size can’t possibly fit all. What works for them won’t necessarily work for you. Just as we all look different, we’re made differently and we work differently. <\/p><p>We take the time to understand your health story and create a personalised treatment pathway. It’s clinically designed to work specifically for you and adapt as you change.  <\/p><p><strong>Turning confusion into clarity <\/strong><\/p><p>The world is noisy. So many choices with conflicting advice and ever-changing opinions can leave you feeling lost and overwhelmed. <\/p><p>We turn confusion into clarity by filtering, refining and curating a healthcare pathway that suits your body and your lifestyle. <\/p><p><strong>Where science meets compassion<\/strong> <\/p><p>It’s often hard to know who to believe and what will actually work for you. <\/p><p>Our clinicians are individually specialised to give you expert advice. Your medication is scientifically proven to work. Add in the one-to-one support on nutrition, exercise, sleep and mental health. Plus tailored supplements for overall wellbeing. That’s whole-person healthcare.  <\/p><p><strong>For lasting change<\/strong> <\/p><p>Quick fixes aren’t sustainable. The more you try, the further it can lead you away from your health goals.<\/p><p>Lasting changes means a lifestyle change. We work together on a realistic approach, setting achievable goals that you can build upon. Over time, you’ll create lasting habits for long-term health.  <\/p><p><strong>Consistency comes with convenience <\/strong><\/p><p>You don’t have time for unnecessary queues. Whether it’s for an appointment, on the phone or at the doctor. <\/p><p>Discreet delivery, online clinician support and the ability to track your progress puts you in control.<\/p>",
            "text_style": "body",
            "text_size": "medium"
          }
        }
      },
